<title>UK: BOE ALLOTS 410 MLN STG IN OUTRIGHT BILLS, REPO.</title>
<headline>BOE ALLOTS 410 MLN STG IN OUTRIGHT BILLS, REPO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 410 million stg of assistance to help offset a revised estimated money market shortage of 550 million.</p>
<p>It allotted 10 million stg in bills outright and 410 million stg in repos to August 21 at the new repo rate of 7.0 percent.</p>
